This is an implementation of the holy brainf*ck programming language.

This implementation simply transform brainf*ck source code to x86_64 assembly.

## How to build:

You'll need a working c compiler, then simply compile brainfuck.c:

`gcc brainfuck.c`

Or I prepared a Makefile, just run:

`make`

## How to use:

You'll need a working assembler. First run:

`./brainfuck tests/helloworld.bf`

This will get you a assembly code as an output. Then assemble the output file:

`gcc a.s`

## Tests

I grabbed some brainfuck code from https://esolangs.org/wiki/Brainfuck as test cases. Run test by:

`make test`
